# The review-feedback log's path, owned by `feedbackLog` in .claude/workflow.json, which points
# here from `feedbackLogLedger` (docs/standards/architecture.md rule 9; #179). The executable
# carriers fail closed on a rename: ci.yml's merge-ritual-gate grep step reds every
# awaiting-review PR, merge-pr.sh's feedback step refuses every humanAlways merge, and
# fill-verdict.sh finds no entry to fill.
owner: .claude/workflow.json
claim: the review-feedback log lives at docs/review-feedback.md, where every humanAlways PR adds its entry
cite: feedbackLog
sweep: \bfeedbackLog\b|review-feedback\.md|\.claude/ledgers/review-feedback-path\.ledger
carrier: .github/workflows/ci.yml
carrier: .claude/scripts/merge-pr.sh
carrier: .claude/scripts/merge-pr.test.sh
carrier: .claude/scripts/fill-verdict.sh
carrier: .claude/scripts/fill-verdict.test.sh
carrier: CLAUDE.md
carrier: .claude/skills/review-loop/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/run-issue/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/retro/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/plan-issue/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/agents/task-orchestrator.md
carrier: .claude/agents/ticket-agent.md
carrier: docs/review-feedback.md
excluded: docs/adr/0002-deployables.md
excluded: docs/adr/0003-model-roles-and-backends.md
excluded: docs/adr/0004-storage.md
excluded: docs/adr/0005-evaluation-as-gate.md
excluded: docs/adr/0006-image-only-slides.md
excluded: docs/friction-log.md
excluded: docs/adr/0007-desktop-packaging.md
